{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"传道书","commonName":"传道书","title":"传道书","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"4f50543f99f7225fcd6ddfe629f589e05c0655922cd97b07218d4e006aaad07c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我见日光之下有一宗祸患重压在人身上，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["就是人蒙 神赐他资财、丰富、尊荣，以致他心里所愿的一样都不缺，只是 神使他不能吃用，反有外人来吃用。这是虚空，也是祸患。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["人若生一百个儿子，活许多岁数，以致他的年日甚多，心里却不得满享福乐，又不得埋葬；据我说，那不到期而落的胎比他倒好。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因为虚虚而来，暗暗而去，名字被黑暗遮蔽，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["并且没有见过天日，也毫无知觉；这胎，比那人倒享安息。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那人虽然活千年，再活千年，却不享福，众人岂不都归一个地方去吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["人的劳碌都为口腹，心里却不知足。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["这样看来，智慧人比愚昧人有什么长处呢？穷人在众人面前知道如何行，有什么长处呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["眼睛所看的比心里妄想的倒好。这也是虚空，也是捕风。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["先前所有的，早已起了名，并知道何为人，他也不能与那比自己力大的相争。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["加增虚浮的事既多，这与人有什么益处呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["人一生虚度的日子，就如影儿经过，谁知道什么与他有益呢？谁能告诉他身后在日光之下有什么事呢？"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}